  <part id="P1">
    <!-- Three movements (the measure numbers restart), played:
         1. |: 1 [1, 2 2 3 :| [3 4 (number="1, 2" and "3", without texts): 1 2 3 1 2 3 1 4
         2. 1 Segno |: 2 3 [1., 3. 4 (Fine) :| [2. 5 6 (D.S. al Fine), the first ending also after the D.S.
            (number="1, 3", drawn as its text "1., 3."): 1 2 3 4 2 3 5 6, after the D.S.: 2 3 4
         3. |: 1 [1, 3 2 :| [2 3 :| 4, the third pass skips the second ending after its own: 1 2 1 3 1 2 4 -->
